        "text": "=You are a Senior QA Engineer with expertise in ServiceNow testing.\n\nAnalyze the following Jira User Story and generate a comprehensive QA test plan.\n\nProject:\n{{ $json.project.key }}\n\nIssue Summary:\n{{ $json.summary }}\n\nDescription:\n{{ $json.description }}\n\nThe description may contain acceptance criteria.\n\nGenerate:\n\n1. Test Scenarios\n2. Positive Test Cases\n3. Negative Test Cases\n4. Boundary Test Cases\n5. Preconditions\n6. Test Steps\n7. Expected Results\n8. Priority\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in the following format:\n\n{\n  \"testCases\": [\n    {\n      \"testCaseId\": \"\",\n      \"scenario\": \"\",\n      \"title\": \"\",\n      \"type\": \"\",\n      \"priority\": \"\",\n      \"preconditions\": \"\",\n      \"steps\": [],\n      \"expectedResult\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
